<title>ITALY: Italy changes 97 deficit/gdp ratio to 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy changes 97 deficit/gdp ratio to 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy will change its official 1997 deficit/gdp ratio to three percent from 4.5 percent, an Italian government official said.</p>
<p>The official said Italy's three-year rolling economic strategy would be amended accordingly and the European Commission would be informed of the change.</p>
</text>
